# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# YOUR CONVERSATIONS LIVE HERE. NEVER COMMIT THESE.
#
# Running the exporter writes your actual Claude Code transcripts into this
# checkout. They routinely contain source code, file paths, API keys pasted
# into prompts, customer data, and private research. Everything the exporter
# generates is ignored below. If you add an output path, ignore it too.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/sessions/
/index/
/extracts/
/timeline/
/index.html
/manifest.json
/manifest.json.tmp

# Exports written somewhere other than the checkout default
/out/
/export/
/archive/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials — defence in depth; this tool never needs any of these
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json
credentials.json
